{
  "name": "Schedule social media posts from Google Sheets with Ampost",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule posts from Google Sheets\n### How it works\nOne row per post. Every 15 minutes, rows with no `status` are scheduled in Ampost, and the row gets the post status and ID.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-ampost** (tested with 0.1.1): Settings → Community nodes → Install, as in the [n8n guide](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/community-nodes/installation/). Until n8n verifies it, the node needs self-hosted n8n.\n2. Create an Ampost credential with an API key from [ampost.io](https://ampost.io/?ref=n8n) → Settings → API keys.\n3. Make a sheet with the columns `text`, `platforms` (comma-separated, e.g. `bluesky,threads`), `publish_at` (e.g. `2026-12-01 09:00`, in the workflow time zone; empty = next queue slot), `link`, `image_url`, `status`, `post_id`.\n4. Pick the sheet in **Read rows** and **Write back the status**.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n\nA failed row gets `error: ...` in `status`; clear it to try again. Scheduling needs a paid Ampost plan; the queue works on every plan.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "755415b6-2e23-4a2b-a11b-01fc37d47970",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "28e54bc8-812f-4eb5-a91e-f3ec32f1e45a",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Sheet1"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "936f7088-bae1-4fa2-af46-56981281bbc5",
      "name": "Read rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "googleSheetsCredential",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "935fecad-a76f-4bf9-acc4-73c387c785b3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cfb438fa-0edd-482e-a35e-c7797cac1fab",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.text }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a9170ac7-4d4b-4f60-ab76-2a7fe4d76aa3",
      "name": "Not posted yet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "platforms": "={{ String($json.platforms).split(',').map(p => p.trim()).filter(p => p) }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "publishMode": "={{ $json.publish_at ? 'schedule' : 'queue' }}",
        "scheduledFor": "={{ $json.publish_at }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "idempotencyKey": "=sheet-{{ $json.row_number }}-{{ $json.text.hash('sha256').slice(0, 16) }}",
          "linkUrl": "={{ $json.link }}",
          "mediaJson": "={{ $json.image_url ? [{ url: $json.image_url, type: 'image' }] : [] }}"
        },
        "platformOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "3fae8df0-f54d-4652-a3db-21165791081f",
      "name": "Schedule the post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ampost.ampost",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ampostApi": {
          "id": "ampostApiCredential",
          "name": "Ampost account"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Sheet1"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "row_number": "={{ $('Not posted yet').item.json.row_number }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.error ? 'error: ' + $json.error : $json.status }}",
            "post_id": "={{ $json.id ?? '' }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_number"
          ],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "row_number",
              "displayName": "row_number",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "number",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "readOnly": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "status",
              "displayName": "status",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "post_id",
              "displayName": "post_id",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9987f7c0-ee0e-4958-ae76-453e808b59c9",
      "name": "Write back the status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "googleSheetsCredential",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Find new rows\nReads the sheet and keeps the rows with an empty `status`.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "74ee8c12-94ef-4965-a6df-658748fc13d0",
      "name": "Section: Find new rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Schedule and write back\nAmpost schedules each row, then the row gets the post status and ID.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e4e98f6c-c719-499f-a340-80dddc8c37e2",
      "name": "Section: Schedule and write back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        -200
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 15 minutes": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read rows",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read rows": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Not posted yet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Not posted yet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Schedule the post",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Schedule the post": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Write back the status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
